\[
\begin{aligned}
a^{2}+\left(r_{1}-r_{2}\right)^{2} & =\left(r_{1}+r_{2}\right)^{2} \\
b^{2}+\left(r_{1}-r_{3}\right)^{2} & =\left(r_{1}+r_{3}\right)^{2} \\
c^{2}+\left(2 r_{1}-r_{2}-r_{3}\right)^{2} & =\left(r_{2}+r_{3}\right)^{2}
\end{aligned}
\]

From the first two equations, we obtain \(a=2 \sqrt{r_{1} r_{2}}\) and \(b=2 \sqrt{r_{1} r_{3}}\). With \(c=|a-b|\), the third equation then becomes

